WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.330
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.788
KATIE RICHARDSON:
One of the things

00:00:04.788 --> 00:00:06.350
that is a little
different in how

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:08.390
we approach this is
that certifications

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:11.870
does require a lot of
professional experience.

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:14.990
You have to have hands-on
experience with our tools

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:17.970
in order to do well on
the certification exams.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:21.500
So that's not something that
comes easily with training.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:26.120
But we definitely collaborate on
the scope of our certifications

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.340
and the scope of the training.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.160
But we do emphasize that,
in addition to training,

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:34.400
you need a lot of
hands-on practice as well.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:38.570
Qwiklabs is one amazing way
to get that hands-on practice.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:41.330
If you maybe aren't
using certain tools

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:44.210
in your day-to-day, you
can use labs to also get

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.460
some of that experience.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:49.610
For our professional
certifications in particular,

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:52.880
the multiple years of actual
professional experience

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:56.030
is very critical in
order to perform well

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:57.440
on those certifications.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:59.540
One of the challenges
with certification

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:03.260
is making sure that that
the individuals that you're

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:06.770
certifying actually
have the skills that we

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:08.430
are saying that they have.

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:12.150
And that's something that
is very difficult to do.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:14.780
But that's why we follow
a very rigorous process

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:19.100
with the design and the
creation of the certifications.

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:22.080
And it's something that we're
constantly looking to improve.

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:23.660
I think in addition
to that, it's

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:26.960
why we do recommend that
professional experience,

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:29.510
so that you're not just
cramming for a test.

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:32.240
It shouldn't be something
that you just go and hope

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:35.390
that you pass, but really
feeling confident in the skills

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:36.530
that you have.

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:39.380
And that's one of the
goals of getting certified,

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:41.360
is really increasing
your confidence

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:43.880
so that you can go into
these new projects,

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:46.640
go into these customer
meetings, and have confidence

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:50.810
that you have the skills
to really perform well

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.930
in your job role.

